Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:14.72,纯中文,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《致命弯道》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.01,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 你太厉害了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, you're great{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:29.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绳索绑好了吗? 是的 快爬吧 慢郎中{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got the line? Yeah, come up slow folk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:44.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道方圆五十英里内半个人影也没 你在对谁鬼叫啊?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know in 50 miles there isn't anybody. Who are you screaming for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:48.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊快点!{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:51.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉我上去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:56.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞奇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rich{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:02:01.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉我上去啦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just pull me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:05.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 别耍贱了 瑞奇 我需要有人拉我一下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, don't be a dick, Richie I need a pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞奇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rich{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:11.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞奇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rich{\r}
