Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:41.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(西维吉尼亚州 绿蔷薇偏僻乡下)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:53.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞奇史托佛和艾蒂丝史密斯 自上周一起就失踪了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard Stover and Edith Smith have been missing since last Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:58.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,截至周末为止尚未返回...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have been failing to return from a weekend at rock...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:13.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道前面怎么了吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got any idea what's going on up here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:19.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前方约五英里处交通堵塞 化学物流的满地都是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traffic jacked about 5 mile up Still chemicals to shit all over the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:22.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道多久能清除完毕吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any idea how long it would take to clean up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个小时吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:26.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个小时?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:27.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赶时间?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in a hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我必须赶到罗里 且我...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I need to take to Roli and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:37.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你只能回你车上 重新另抄一条捷径看看啰{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you should do is get back in your car pick your short cut one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:06.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 桃乐丝我是克里斯弗林{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Doris, this is Chris Flinn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:09.49,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我下午三点要与凯勒先生面试{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have at3 PM an interview with Mr. Keller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:13.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概会迟到半个钟头 不知道你能不能...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm arriving about 30 minutes later, so I wonder if you could...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can it make this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(距加油站一英里远)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:12.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 先生 你们有公共电话吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir Do you have a pay phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:27.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这支坏掉了 还有别支电话可以借我打吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's not working. Do you have another phone I can use?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:29.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打长途的?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long distance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这里打有哪里不是长途?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What isn't long distance from here, alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:35.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在对我吼吗 孩子?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got wild at me, son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:40.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 先生 我只是... 我有点迟了 我真的需要打通电话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, I'm just... I'm running behind, I really need to make a call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:44.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我仅有的电话了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that is my only phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:46.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:55.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 公路上塞车 你知道别条路可以通出去吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, highway road is jammed up. Do you know of another road heading us out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:56.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:07.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条山路怎么会像这样涂上颜色?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is this certain mountain road dyed like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是路?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're road?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:13.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们还没重印地图呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they ain't go around the paper yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:17.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来走这条路约有15、20英里路程 对吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like it runs in the highway about 15, 20 miles, is that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说是就是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢 保重了 好吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much Take care, ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:41.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才需要好好保重{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the one gonna need take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(熊山路)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:20.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉 我刚好...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:23.42,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚回过头 没注意到...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just come from the back, I didn't even see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:25.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分神了 天哪 你可能撞死呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got distracted Oh God, you could die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:28.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们全都没事吧? 是的 你想坐下来吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are all OK? Yeah, You wanna sit down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:29.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能会有脑震荡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might be in a state of shock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:32.45,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干嘛? 开车开的那么快 好了 好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing? You're driving so god damn fast Alright, alright{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:36.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的车怎会停在路中间? 因为轮胎破了啊混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was your truck parked in the middle of the road? Because you broke our tyre, you asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我会赔偿我撞坏的一切损失{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I will pay for everything I've damaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:40.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 妈的 没错 你要赔偿 那是我妈的车子呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, damn, you're right, you're gonna pay, that's my Mom's car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:44.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 大伙 这人说会赔的...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, friends, the man said he'd pay for it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你毁了我的自行车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you killed my bike here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的车胎怎会破了呢?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you ruin your tyres?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在路中央放置了铁丝网{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone left some barb wires in the middle of the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:55.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信竟然有人将它掉在这里 没有人掉了什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe someone just dropped it there. Nobody dropped anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:13:00.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚发现铁丝网一端固定在树后面 是有人故意的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just found found it tied to the tree back there. Somebody did this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的待客之道太差了 该死的混蛋!{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their hospitality is worse Redneck assholes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:07.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我要设法弄支电话 我想后面几英里处有座加油站{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm going to try to find a phone. I think there's a gas station a couple of miles back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna come with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:12.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有电话 我刚刚去过了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no phone. I was just there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:16.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们何不等别人经过呢? 像这儿的赛车手一样吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we wait for someone else to come along? Well, like speedracer here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:18.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我哪里也不去 好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm not going anywhere. Ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:21.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去吧 我不知道 我们要留在这里 法兰西...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys go I dont' know, we're gonna stay here, Francine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:23.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...好好享受一番 对 那又怎样?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get high Yeah, so what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:29.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你叫什么名字?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克里斯弗林{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris Flinn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:33.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤了 克里斯弗林?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hurt, Chris Flinn?{\r}
