Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.72,0:50:28.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁西 谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jess. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.92,0:51:09.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊是无线电{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God, it's a radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.36,0:51:15.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西还相当耐用{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thing works pretty stark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.84,0:51:18.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道怎么操作吗? 让我试试{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how to use this? Let me try{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.24,0:51:23.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想还能用 别乱动 继续试试所有频道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it still works. Don't move anything, just keep on all the frequencies they had on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.68,0:51:28.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人听见吗? 我们有紧急事故 有人听见吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can anybody hear me? We have an emergency. Can anybody hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.56,0:51:34.04,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我们遇上重大紧急事故 拜讬 有人听见吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we have a huge emergency, please, is there anybody hear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.76,0:51:37.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人受伤了 我们需要救助{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone is injured. We need a help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.08,0:51:42.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜讬 外面有人听见我吗? 喂?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, is there anybody out that can hear me? Hello{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.60,0:51:43.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.68,0:51:48.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趴下 灯光盖住{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down Cover the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.16,0:52:08.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们他们过去了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they're passing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.40,0:52:23.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是报案中心 收的到吗? 你的位置在哪?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is ???. Can you copy? Where is your position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.76,0:52:28.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吗? 你们位置在哪里?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy? Where's your position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.24,0:52:31.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚我的位置 帮帮我们就是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know my position. Just help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.76,0:52:37.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没听到 请重覆 你的位置在哪 他们来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't copy that, repeat, what is your position. They're coming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.56,0:52:46.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到 我们不知道我们的位置 我们在一座了望塔 一定在北边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy, we don't know our position, we're in a watchtower. We must be in north of ???{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.28,0:52:51.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人想杀我们 拜讬 他们杀害了我们的朋友 快救救我们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's trying to kill us.Please. They've murdered our friends. Help us right now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.84,0:52:55.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留在原地 收到了吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay there, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.20,0:52:58.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 收到 请派警察过来 这是紧急事故{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I copy Just bring the police, this is an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.76,0:53:00.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我搬这个 快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me move this, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.92,0:53:06.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人中弹了 我们朋友被杀了 拜讬救救我们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's been shot, Out friends have been killed. Help us out, please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.84,0:53:08.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.36,0:53:37.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在干嘛?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.36,0:53:39.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.92,0:53:45.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们下去了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they're going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.16,0:53:47.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.76,0:54:07.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 喂 有人在吗? 听得见我们吗? 喂?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, hello, is there anybody there? Can you hear us? Hello{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.84,0:54:40.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 他们在干什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, what are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.64,0:54:44.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失火了 他们想烧死我们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on fire They're trying to burn us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.80,0:54:48.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.32,0:55:00.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.56,0:55:04.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来 放开我 放手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here Let go of me, let go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.96,0:55:07.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿跳下去也不愿被烧死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather jump than burn to death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.40,0:55:11.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.96,0:55:14.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对 什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.64,0:55:17.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说的对 我们必须跳下去 离底下树枝只有几尺高{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right, we have to jump. the branch is only a few feet down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.80,0:55:19.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎超过二十尺呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more like 20 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.44,0:55:21.14,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 洁西 我不想这样子被烧死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Jess, I don't want to be burned like this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.14,0:55:22.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想被砍成肉块 我们行的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be chopped into pieces, we can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.56,0:55:23.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先跳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go first{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.48,0:55:27.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克里斯 嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris, hey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.84,0:56:18.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克里斯 克里斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris, Chris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.48,0:56:50.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧? 你想他们看见我们吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're OK? Do you think this is us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.96,0:56:53.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.92,0:57:04.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得移动 快点 该死 该死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta move. Come on. Shit, shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.32,0:57:24.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉 快点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carly, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.72,0:58:33.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不行 我不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do this I can't do this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.40,0:59:07.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.04,0:59:28.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.44,0:59:30.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我有个计划 来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I have a plan. Come on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.76,0:59:41.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁西 这边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jessie, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.68,1:00:06.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能抓住这个吗? 为什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hold this? Why?{\r}
