Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.04,1:00:15.61,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 等到我停住不动再放手 好吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, don't let go until I cease, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.64,1:00:18.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里? 我去确保一下他会从这边来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going? I'm gonna make sure he comes this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.56,1:00:22.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你走路不像我这么快 洁西 洁西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can't walk as quick as I can. Jessie, Jessie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.84,1:00:47.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里 来抓我啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm right here. Come and get me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.32,1:00:53.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在哪里?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.36,1:00:58.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.20,1:03:38.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友的事很遗憾{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.88,1:03:45.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上周五我回家 答录机上有通讯息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last Friday I came home and there was the message on my machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.12,1:03:52.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我男友说我们该分手了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From my boyfried who says that we shouldn't be together anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.04,1:04:00.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过了二十分钟后 我告诉卡莉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After 20 minutes I've been telling Carly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.28,1:04:04.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫史考特...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has Scott and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.96,1:04:11.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...艾凡和法兰西 这个礼拜全体带我出来散散心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Evan and Francine. All for this week to take me out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.88,1:04:14.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是这种朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the kind of friends they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.96,1:04:19.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今他们死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.48,1:04:31.04,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.08,1:05:02.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.04,1:05:14.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 那是你在作梦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that are your dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.92,1:05:17.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿如此{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish.{\r}
