Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.28,1:06:10.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道路 什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Road What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.88,1:06:14.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备下去那里 那就从斜坡下去吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're ready to get down there. Get by slope right then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.56,1:06:20.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it.{\r}
