Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.44,1:07:04.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 我们得赶去 冷静一下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we gotta move. Just calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.68,1:07:07.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是从失火的塔上通知我来其中一个吗? 我一直到处找你们呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one of them that called me from the fire tower? I've been looking all over for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.44,1:07:11.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜讬 闭嘴听我说 有人死了 死了 什么人?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, shut up and listen. People are dead Dead, what people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.52,1:09:44.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我 拜讬{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, please.{\r}
